---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Home Modifications | Aging at Home Lab" description="Questions to ask before aging-in-place home modifications such as grab bars, ramps, stair lifts, shower changes, lighting, and flooring.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Home Modifications</p>
      <h1>Before changing the home, understand the actual problem.</h1>
      <p class="lede">This section will help families think through grab bars, ramps, stair lifts, shower changes, lighting, flooring, thresholds, and contractor questions without turning product shopping into a substitute for assessment.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="guide-grid" aria-label="Home modification roadmap">
    <article class="guide-card">
      <div class="guide-meta"><span class="badge">Roadmap</span><span class="badge warning-badge">planned</span></div>
      <h3>Grab Bars: Where They Help and What to Ask Before Installation</h3>
      <p>How to think about placement, wall structure, movement patterns, and professional installation questions.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="guide-card">
      <div class="guide-meta"><span class="badge">Roadmap</span><span class="badge warning-badge">planned</span></div>
      <h3>Shower Chair vs Transfer Bench</h3>
      <p>What families should compare before buying bathroom seating or transfer equipment.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="guide-card">
      <div class="guide-meta"><span class="badge">Roadmap</span><span class="badge warning-badge">planned</span></div>
      <h3>Ramp Planning Questions</h3>
      <p>Questions about slope, entryways, weather, space, railings, mobility aids, and professional installation.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="guide-card">
      <div class="guide-meta"><span class="badge">Roadmap</span><span class="badge warning-badge">planned</span></div>
      <h3>Lighting and Trip-Hazard Upgrades</h3>
      <p>Small changes that may make daily movement easier before major remodeling is considered.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="callout warning">
    <h2>Major changes need qualified review.</h2>
    <p>Home modifications should match the person, the home, and the real movement pattern. Future guides in this section should explain what to ask professionals, not pretend a generic article can design a safe modification.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
